{"ticker":"MGM","updated":"2026-10-23T23:17:44Z","profile":{"longName":"MGM Resorts International","shortName":"MGM Resorts International","sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Resorts & Casinos","country":"United States","website":"https://www.mgmresorts.com","fullTimeEmployees":60000,"marketCap":7179185664,"trailingPE":17.320988,"forwardPE":15.887665,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":0.4042006,"pegRatio":0.37,"targetMeanPrice":41.68421,"targetHighPrice":57.0,"targetLowPrice":29.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":19,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.01,"earningsGrowth":5.194,"grossMargins":0.44157,"operatingMargins":0.067880005,"profitMargins":0.02398,"totalRevenue":17761441792,"beta":1.351,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":51.59,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":27.685,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"MGM Resorts International, through its subsidiaries, operates as a gaming and entertainment company in the United States, China, and internationally. It operates through four segments: Las Vegas Strip Resorts, Regional Operations, MGM China, and MGM Digital. The company operates casino resorts that offer gaming, hotel, convention, dining, entertainment, retail, and other resort amenities, as well as online/digital games through its online platforms. Its casino operations include slots and table games, as well as live dealer, online sports betting, and iGaming through BetMGM. The company's customers include premium gaming customers; leisure and wholesale travel customers; business travelers; and group customers, including conventions, trade associations, and small meetings. The company was formerly known as MGM MIRAGE and changed its name to MGM Resorts International in June 2010. MGM Resorts International was incorporated in 1986 and is based in Las Vegas, Nevada.","summary_zh":"米高梅國際酒店集團透過其子公司在美國、中國和國際上作為博彩和娛樂公司運作。該公司透過四個部門運營：拉斯維加斯大道度假村部門、區域營運部門、米高梅中國部門和米高梅數位部門。該公司經營賭場度假村，提供博彩、酒店、會議、餐飲、娛樂、零售和其他度假村設施，以及透過其線上平台提供的線上/數位遊戲。其賭場業務包括老虎機和桌上遊戲，以及真人荷官、線上體育博彩和 BetMGM 的 iGaming。該公司的客戶包括優質遊戲客戶；休閒和批發旅遊客戶；商務旅客；以及團體客戶，包括會議、行業協會和小型會議。該公司前身為米高梅幻影 (MGM MIRAGE)，並於 2010 年 6 月更名為米高梅國際度假村 (MGM Resorts International)。米高梅國際度假村 (MGM Resorts International) 成立於 1986 年，總部位於內華達州拉斯維加斯。","sector_zh":"週期性消費","industry_zh":"度假村及賭場","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":38.07,"h":38.26,"l":37.77,"c":38.12,"v":3207100},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":38.15,"h":38.64,"l":38.02,"c":38.51,"v":4598900},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":38.51,"h":39.89,"l":38.3,"c":39.77,"v":4462900},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":39.97,"h":40.16,"l":39.37,"c":39.59,"v":3384300},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":39.54,"h":39.76,"l":39.26,"c":39.69,"v":2985900},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":39.12,"h":39.12,"l":38.36,"c":38.91,"v":4262800},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":38.66,"h":39.14,"l":38.03,"c":38.11,"v":3656200},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":38.2,"h":38.31,"l":36.97,"c":37.03,"v":4794500},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":37.22,"h":38.18,"l":36.33,"c":36.68,"v":4910000},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":36.65,"h":36.7,"l":35.87,"c":36.2,"v":4433000},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":36.1,"h":36.41,"l":35.81,"c":36.0,"v":2842700},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":35.95,"h":36.32,"l":35.79,"c":35.95,"v":3065200},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":35.75,"h":36.1,"l":35.33,"c":35.34,"v":6620600},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":35.17,"h":35.23,"l":34.35,"c":34.55,"v":5226600},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":34.7,"h":36.24,"l":34.61,"c":35.64,"v":6513200},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":35.59,"h":36.06,"l":34.91,"c":35.36,"v":4264500},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":35.5,"h":36.04,"l":34.7,"c":35.29,"v":3626000},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":35.46,"h":36.03,"l":35.18,"c":35.94,"v":3723900},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":36.31,"h":36.51,"l":35.7,"c":35.8,"v":7168900},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":35.57,"h":35.6,"l":34.48,"c":34.49,"v":6073300},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":34.55,"h":35.23,"l":34.55,"c":34.77,"v":4726900},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":34.78,"h":34.88,"l":34.1,"c":34.55,"v":4406700},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":34.28,"h":34.71,"l":34.15,"c":34.48,"v":4074900},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":34.53,"h":35.8,"l":34.53,"c":35.6,"v":4411100},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":36.02,"h":36.84