nk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-11","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/789570/000078957026000018/mgm-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"MGM Resorts International is referred to as the \"Company,\" \"MGM Resorts,\" or the \"Registrant,\" and together with its subsidiaries may also be referred to as \"we,\" \"us\" or \"our.\"","zh":"米高梅國際酒店集團被稱為“公司”、“米高梅度假村”或“註冊人”，與其子公司一起也可能被稱為“我們”、“我們”或“我們的”。"},{"en":"MGM Resorts International is a Delaware corporation incorporated in 1986 that acts largely as a holding company and, through subsidiaries, is a global gaming and entertainment company with domestic and international locations featuring best-in-class hotels and casinos, state-of-the-art meeting and conference spaces, incredible live and theatrical entertainment experiences, and an extensive array of restaurant, nightlife and retail offerings, as well as sports betting and online gaming operations.","zh":"米高梅國際酒店集團是一家於 1986 年在特拉華州註冊成立的公司，主要作為一家控股公司，並透過子公司成為一家全球性博彩和娛樂公司，在國內和國際設有分支機構，擁有一流的酒店和賭場、最先進的會議空間、令人難以置信的現場和戲劇娛樂體驗、廣泛的餐廳、夜生活和零售服務，以及體育博彩和線上服務。"},{"en":"We believe we operate several of the finest casino properties in the world and we continually reinvest in our properties to maintain our competitive advantage. We make significant investments in our properties through newly remodeled hotel rooms, restaurants, entertainment and nightlife offerings, as well as other new features and amenities. We believe we operate the highest quality resorts in each of the markets in which we operate. Ensuring our properties are the premier resorts in their respective markets requires capital investments to maintain the best possible experiences for our guests. We also believe that through our online gaming operations, we can create a scaled global online gaming business.","zh":"我們相信，我們經營著世界上最好的幾家賭場物業，我們不斷對我們的物業進行再投資，以保持我們的競爭優勢。我們透過新改建的飯店客房、餐廳、娛樂和夜生活設施以及其他新功能和設施對我們的物業進行了大量投資。我們相信，我們在我們經營的每個市場中都經營著最優質的度假村。確保我們的酒店成為各自市場中的頂級度假村需要資本投資，以便為我們的客人提供最佳的體驗。我們也相信，透過我們的線上遊戲業務，我們可以創建規模化的全球線上遊戲業務。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"We operate in highly competitive environments. We compete against gaming companies, as well as other hospitality companies in the markets in which we operate, neighboring markets, and in other parts of the world, including non-gaming resort destinations such as Hawaii. Our gaming operations compete to a lesser extent with state-sponsored lotteries, off-track wagering, card parlors, and other forms of legalized gaming in the United States and internationally. For further discussion of the potential impact of competitive conditions on our business, see \"","zh":"我們在競爭激烈的環境中運作。我們在我們經營的市場、鄰近市場和世界其他地區（包括夏威夷等非博彩度假勝地）與博彩公司以及其他酒店公司競爭。我們的博彩業務與美國和國際上國家資助的彩票、場外投注、紙牌店和其他形式的合法博彩業務的競爭程度較小。有關競爭條件對我們業務的潛在影響的進一步討論，請參閱“"}],"competition":[],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Las Vegas Strip Resorts","val":8441503000,"zh":"拉斯維加斯大道度假村"},{"name":"MGM China","val":4461743000,"zh":"米高梅中國"},{"name":"Regional Operations","val":3772333000,"zh":"區域營運"}],"total":17537683000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Casino","val":9450887000,"zh":"賭場"},{"name":"Occupancy","val":3377400000,"zh":"佔用"},{"name":"Food & Beverage","val":3045965000,"zh":"食品及飲料"},{"name":"Entertainment Retail & Other","val":1663431000,"zh":"娛樂零售及其他"}],"total":17537683000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"US","val":12411625000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"CN","val":4464095000,"zh":"中國"},{"name":"Non US Other","val":661963000,"zh":"非美國其他"}],"total":17537683000}},"peers":["LVS","WYNN","CZR","PENN","NCLH"]}}